# Feature Preview Kit

Follow `skills/feature-preview-kit/SKILL.md` exactly; it is the source of truth.

- Phase A (planner): one locked base per `{root}` in `.agentic_coding/base/`; reuse it when locked, otherwise ask the user for full setup or the neutral kit. Run the CLI with `--root {root}`.
- Phase B (programming skill): one preview per feature in `.agentic_coding/feature/{feature_slug}/`; never edit the base; report base gaps so planning can amend it.
- Never hand-edit built HTML; never invent brand values; tokens only.
